egal receives and reviews the AWS SOC 2 Type 2 report annually.",\n    "cuec_line_ref": 895,\n    "cuec_confidence": 0.4,\n    "cuec_gpt_opinion": "Yes",\n    "cuec_distance_from_cuec_keywords": 9,\n    "cuec_gpt_reasoning": "This control explicitly states the responsibility of SimpleLegal to receive and review the AWS SOC 2 Type 2 report annually.",\n    "cuec_framework_alignment": "TSC",\n    "cuec_framework_alignment_id": "C1.6",\n    "cuec_justification": "Undetermined"\n  },\n  {\n    "cuec_seq": 5,\n    "cuec_tsc_id": "A1.2",\n    "cuec_description": "Through its operational activities, SimpleLegal monitors the services performed by AWS to determine whether operations and controls expected to be implemented at the subservice organization are functioning effectively. SimpleLegal also has communication with the subservice organization to monitor compliance with the service agreements, stay up to date on planned changes at the hosting facilities, and communicate any issues or concerns to AWS.",\n    "cuec_line_ref": 852,\n    "cuec_confidence": 0.7,\n    "cuec_gpt_opinion": "Yes",\n    "cuec_distance_from_cuec_keywords": 7,\n    "cuec_gpt_reasoning": "This control explicitly states the responsibility of SimpleLegal to monitor the services performed by AWS, determine the effectiveness of operations and controls at the subservice organization, communicate with the subservice organization, monitor compliance, stay updated on changes, and communicate issues or concerns to AWS.",\n    "cuec_framework_alignment": "TSC",\n    "cuec_framework_alignment_id": "A1.2",\n    "cuec_justification": "Undetermined"\n  },\n  {\n    "cuec_seq": 3,\n    "cuec_tsc_id": "P3.2",\n    "cuec_description": "User entities are responsible for obtaining explicit consent of data subjects when disclosing personal information to third parties.",\n    "cuec_line_ref": 822,\n    "cuec_confidence": 1.0,\n    "cuec_gpt_opinion": "Yes",\n    "cuec_distance_from_cuec_keywords": 0,\n    "cuec_gpt_reas